{
    "background_story": "Greyson was a talented young musician who had a passion for singing. Growing up in a family of modest means, he often found solace in the local church choir, where he could let his voice soar. Greyson's vocal range was remarkable, but it was his ability to sing a descant - a high-pitched harmony above the main melody - that truly set him apart. His ethereal voice added a haunting beauty to the choir's performances, earning him recognition and accolades from the community. As he honed his craft, Greyson began to compose his own music, incorporating intricate descants that showcased his vocal prowess. His unique sound eventually caught the attention of a renowned music producer, who offered him a record deal. Greyson's music career took off, with his descants becoming a signature element of his artistry.",
